  "description": "One day, “Rose” got lost in the forest and met the “Ghost” who lived there. She set out to prove that this “nobody”—a person the world said didn’t exist—was real, and ended up falling in love. But a “Witch” keeps getting between them…\nNow I’ve become the “nobody” instead. \n\nCan our love ever come true?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=844571), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13355629)\n\n**Official Translations:**    \n[S.Chinese](https://www.dongmanmanhua.cn/LOVE/bucunzaideren/list?title_no=2888)",
